 "remarks": "This is the condo you have been waiting for in the sought after Strathmore Lane Complex. This home boasts a large living area with hardwood flooring and a wood burning fireplace that is open to a dining area just off the kitchen. The composite deck is accessed through a sliding door off of the living room and offers a lovely wooded view. A great condo for entertaining with a updated kitchen, front hall closet and powder room. The second floor offers a spacious primary en suite with a walk-in-closet and a second bedroom with a walk-in-closet. Luxury Vinyl plank flooring has been recently added to the 2nd floor. The attic is great for storage and accessed via a pull down staircase in the upper hallway. The laundry is perfectly located on the second floor. This complex offers a beautiful private pool setting. The beauty of Strathmore is the proximity to Westport stores, restaurants, Saugatuck, Sherwood Island State Park, Levitt Pavilion, RT 95 and walking distance to the Westport train station. This location can't be beat with the best of both world's living on the edge of both Westport and Norwalk. This property offers a Westport address and Norwalk amenities and schools.",
